   "title_en": "To / towards: -e and -a",
   "explanation": "**-e / -a** shows direction: to, towards, into.\n- eve (to the house), okula (to school).\n- After a vowel a **y** joins: araba**ya**, İstanbul'a but Ankara'**ya**.\n- Some verbs take this case: **bakmak** (to look at): Bana bak. **binmek** (to get on): Otobüse bindim.\n- ben → bana, sen → sana (to me, to you).",
